#. Description of the plugin
#: account-menu-enhancer-for-hivepress.php
msgid "Unifies the HivePress and WooCommerce account areas into one consistent menu, with per-item icons, colours and labels, nested items, custom menu items, control over which items each account menu shows, and persistent menu items that stay visible with a helpful notice when their pages are empty."
msgstr ""

