msgstr ""

#: includes/configs/settings.php:286
#: includes/configs/settings.php:292
msgid "Custom Items"
msgstr ""

#: includes/configs/settings.php:287
msgid "Add your own links to the account menus. Each item needs a label and either a link from the dropdown or a custom URL. To decide where an item sits in the menu, drag it in the Live preview panel above, alongside the built-in items. An item nested under a parent always sits inside that parent; drag it to change its place among the other items there."
msgstr ""

#: includes/configs/settings.php:293
msgid "Everything except the label and link is optional. A parent item must be a top-level item shown in the same menu; save a new custom item once before choosing it as a parent. Administrators always see every item, so check a role restriction with a non-administrator account. An item nested under a role-restricted custom item sits at the top level for members who cannot see that parent."
msgstr ""

